WEBVTT

00:00:05.928 --> 00:00:06.799
Whoa!

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:08.104
[GROANS]

00:00:08.279 --> 00:00:10.106
MAVIS: Dennis! Are you okay?

00:00:10.281 --> 00:00:12.108
I got a candy.

00:00:12.283 --> 00:00:14.067
Look! Your tooth came out.

00:00:14.241 --> 00:00:16.591
Are you kidding me?
He got his tooth knocked out?

00:00:16.765 --> 00:00:19.725
Oh, yes, indeed.
Here comes the fang.

00:00:19.899 --> 00:00:22.858
Dad.
His baby tooth wasn't a fang.
Why would this one be?

00:00:23.032 --> 00:00:24.556
He's not a monster.

00:00:25.557 --> 00:00:26.732
[SNIFFING]

00:00:26.906 --> 00:00:27.602
Ooh!

00:00:28.037 --> 00:00:30.170
[SIGHS]

00:00:30.344 --> 00:00:32.477
The sun's gonna come out soon,
and we gotta get
to his classes.

00:00:32.651 --> 00:00:36.219
What's wrong with
the classes we have here?
Like the kids' yoga?

00:00:36.394 --> 00:00:40.354
Yoga!

00:00:40.528 --> 00:00:42.487
This is Denisovich's home.

00:00:42.661 --> 00:00:44.097
I don't know, Dad.

00:00:44.271 --> 00:00:45.620
What don't you know?

00:00:45.794 --> 00:00:49.102
Well, we've been
talking about moving.

00:00:49.276 --> 00:00:51.626
Somewhere safer
for Dennis.

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:54.586
Maybe where Johnny
grew up in California.

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:58.546
I'm sorry, but you can't
just make somebody
something they're not.

00:01:00.722 --> 00:01:02.071
Come on, honey.
We have to go.

00:01:02.245 --> 00:01:03.421
Zing, zing?

00:01:04.639 --> 00:01:07.338
Mavey, wait.
You can't mean that.

00:01:10.863 --> 00:01:12.560
You're in on this?
The leaving?

00:01:12.734 --> 00:01:15.476
Uh...
It's not definite at all.

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:16.999
It's just something
she's definitely
talking about,

00:01:17.173 --> 00:01:19.132
but until we do it,
it's not definitized.

00:01:22.657 --> 00:01:24.485
Did he just cover
me with birdseed?

00:01:25.486 --> 00:01:26.705
Yeah, he covered me.

00:01:26.879 --> 00:01:27.706
[CAWING]

00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:39.848
Dad, it's not a fang.

00:01:40.022 --> 00:01:42.982
Dad, I don't know
if it's the right
place for Dennis.

00:01:43.156 --> 00:01:44.723
Right, Johnny?

00:01:44.897 --> 00:01:47.987
Oh, hey, dudeman.
It's not me. It's Mavey.

00:01:48.161 --> 00:01:51.425
Hey, dudeman.
I'm afraid to say anything.

00:01:51.599 --> 00:01:53.775
Hey, dudeman. I'm a dudeman!

00:01:53.949 --> 00:01:56.343
Uh, Drac? Who you talkin' to?

00:01:56.517 --> 00:01:58.606
Do not disturb.
The count's
wiggin' out in here.

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:01.870
What are you
wiggin' out about, Drac?

00:02:02.044 --> 00:02:05.308
The kids.
Mavey Wavey's saying
she wants to leave.

00:02:05.483 --> 00:02:08.007
She wants to leave?
What about Johnny?
He doesn't wanna go.

00:02:08.181 --> 00:02:10.357
He's making
the hotel more human-y
for Dennis.

00:02:10.531 --> 00:02:12.141
You know, seeing
that he isn't a monster.

00:02:12.315 --> 00:02:13.621
He is a monster!

00:02:13.795 --> 00:02:14.753
He's just a late fanger.

00:02:14.927 --> 00:02:15.928
Mmm-hmm.

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:17.495
And I could be a hand model.

00:02:17.669 --> 00:02:19.758
Shut up!
It's all that human-y stuff

00:02:19.932 --> 00:02:23.414
that's confusing
poor Denisovich.

00:02:23.588 --> 00:02:26.547
So maybe you gotta get the kid
around more monster-y things.
Ooh!

00:02:26.721 --> 00:02:28.810
Oh, I need a cape.

00:02:28.984 --> 00:02:31.944
DRACULA: I can't.
She's always around,
checking up on me.

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:35.251
Man, if you could
just get some alone time.

00:02:35.426 --> 00:02:37.732
DRACULA: Wait a minute.
That's what Johnny wants, too.

00:02:38.777 --> 00:02:40.909
Alone time with Mavis.

00:02:43.738 --> 00:02:44.826
[STRAINING] Have
they even had a vacation

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.349
since before
they were married?

00:02:46.524 --> 00:02:47.438
[TOILET FLUSHING]

00:02:50.571 --> 00:02:53.705
They're going to now.
And so are we.
Frank, you're a genius.

00:03:05.499 --> 00:03:06.239
Mmm-hmm.

00:03:07.545 --> 00:03:08.241
[CLEARS THROAT]

00:03:10.722 --> 00:03:13.072
We'll take Denisovich
to all our old haunts.

00:03:13.246 --> 00:03:14.943
[RAT SQUEAKING]

00:03:15.117 --> 00:03:16.031
Each of us will
show him our skills.

00:03:18.643 --> 00:03:20.688
Teach him how to be a monster.

00:03:23.212 --> 00:03:25.606
And he'll be
fanging it up in no time.

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:27.869
Boy turns five next week.

00:03:28.043 --> 00:03:30.437
If he's not
a vampire by his birthday,
it ain't happenin'.

00:03:30.611 --> 00:03:32.744
Oh, it ain't
ain't happening, baby.

00:03:32.918 --> 00:03:35.094
All he needs is
time with his vampa.

00:03:35.268 --> 00:03:36.530
"Vampa"?

00:03:36.704 --> 00:03:37.923
Vampire grandpa.

00:03:38.097 --> 00:03:40.012
Come on, man.
That's obvious.

00:03:42.405 --> 00:03:44.538
Johnny. Come outside.

00:03:44.712 --> 00:03:46.975
What? Who is it?

00:03:47.149 --> 00:03:49.587
It's your father-in-law.
I need to talk to you.

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:52.285
What's up?

00:03:53.025 --> 00:03:54.026
Oh.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:56.332
Let me get rid of them. Sorry.

00:03:56.507 --> 00:03:59.466
No problem-o.
I was kinda
diggin' the attention.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:00.554
[CHIRPING]

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:04.515
Can they stay?
I don't think
they're ready to leave yet.

00:04:04.689 --> 00:04:06.734
Come on. Go to your mother.

00:04:06.908 --> 00:04:07.953
Look,
you want to stay here, right?

00:04:08.127 --> 00:04:09.911
Of course.

00:04:10.085 --> 00:04:12.653
This is the first place
where I can really be myself.

00:04:12.827 --> 00:04:16.135
I haven't felt this alive
since they invented
stuffed-crust pizza.

00:04:16.309 --> 00:04:20.531
Well, then,
we've got some work to do.
Okay, so here's the plan.

00:04:20.705 --> 00:04:22.794
[WHISPERING]
Maybe it's a good idea
to take her to your hometown.

00:04:22.968 --> 00:04:25.100
But remember... [INAUDIBLE]

00:04:25.274 --> 00:04:27.973
So, it's sliced avocado,
rolled oats with apricot,

00:04:28.147 --> 00:04:30.366
the Aveeno
moisturizer after every bath.

00:04:30.541 --> 00:04:33.718
And then the shea butter
on his tush before his PJs

00:04:33.892 --> 00:04:36.547
and then 20 minutes
with the nebulizer

00:04:36.721 --> 00:04:39.811
while I read
his Learning Factory
Phonics book to him.

00:04:39.985 --> 00:04:43.249
It's asking a lot, Dad.
We could just
take Dennis with us.

00:04:43.423 --> 00:04:46.121
What? Are you kidding me?
And get him off his routine?

00:04:46.295 --> 00:04:47.470
No, no, no.

00:04:47.645 --> 00:04:49.647
You kids go to California,

00:04:49.821 --> 00:04:52.040
and see if it's
the right place
to raise Denisovich.

00:04:52.214 --> 00:04:53.955
And you remember
how to video chat?

00:04:54.129 --> 00:04:57.306
Yes, yes. With the phone
and the buttons and the agony.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:01.223
Thanks for being so
understanding, Dad.
I know you'll keep him safe.

00:05:01.397 --> 00:05:04.836
Of course, Mavey.
Stake my heart
and hope to die.

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:06.838
I'm just gonna
miss him so much.

00:05:07.926 --> 00:05:09.492
I love you, Dennis.

00:05:09.667 --> 00:05:11.407
I love you, Mommy.

00:05:11.582 --> 00:05:15.020
I'll tell him
Mavey Wavey stories
every night before bed.

00:05:15.194 --> 00:05:17.022
You're the best.
I love you, Dad.

00:05:20.373 --> 00:05:22.941
Gonna miss all you guys.
You're all my family.

00:05:23.681 --> 00:05:25.683
Love you, Drac.

00:05:25.857 --> 00:05:28.076
Yes. I love you, too.

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:31.863
Now, remember the plan.
Just keep her
distracted and happy.

00:05:32.037 --> 00:05:34.343
But not too happy,
capisce? Got it.

00:05:34.517 --> 00:05:36.955
Operation
"Just Keep Her
Distracted and Happy,

00:05:37.129 --> 00:05:40.306
"But Not Too Happy, Capisce,"
starts now. Cool?

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:41.829
Smiling on the outside.

00:05:42.003 --> 00:05:42.961
Will you hug my backpack?

00:05:43.135 --> 00:05:43.962
No.

